  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nigerien Youth in Action: Supporting the Active Role of Young Women and Men for the Consolidation of Peace in Diffa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to contribute to the consolidation of peace by facilitating the accessibility of young women and men to civic spaces and natural resources in the Diffa region. The specific objectives of the project are: 1) the operationalization of civic spaces and the optimization of their access to young women and young men of the Diffa region; 2) Strengthening the resilience capacities of young women and young men in the preservation, accessibility and rational management of natural resources (water and land); and 3) the mobilization of young women and men to strengthen social cohesion and prevent violent extremism.</narrative>
  </description>
